<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34933" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">per-flŭo</span></b> , xi, 3, v.
			a. and n.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Act.</i>, <i>to flow</i> or <i>run through</i> (post-class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pluvialibus nimbis perfluuntur,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Arn. 6, 191</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Neutr.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>To flow</i> or <i>run through</i>
				(<b>poet.</b> and in post-Aug. prose): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">per colum vina videmus Perfluere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					2, 392</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Petr.
			23</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			In gen., <i>to flow</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quasi in vas commoda perfluere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					3, 937</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Belus amnis in mare perfluens,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					36, 26, 65, § 190</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>To drip</i> with any thing (postclass.): sudore perfluere, <i><span class="en">App. M. 1,
				p. 108, 1</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>c.</b> Of long garments, <i>to flow</i> or <i>float</i> (post-class.),
				<i><span class="en">App. M. 11, p. 258,
			30</span></i>.—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: plenus rimarum sum: hac atque illac
			perfluo, <i>I leak</i>, i. e. <i>I cannot
				keep the secret</i>, <i><span class="en">Ter. Eun. 1, 2, 25</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
